List the live Copilot catalog for a plan host in model.base_url.

A bare https:// root of a host the provider claims (Copilot: githubcopilot.com
and subdomains, e.g. api.business.githubcopilot.com) is the provider's own
endpoint, not a relay. Backport of NousResearch/hermes-agent#142481 to 0.22.5,
which has no profile hostnames: the claim is listed in route_identity.
Tracking: issues/hermes-agent-copilot-business-catalog.md

